🏡 Elite Interiors

A modern and elegant interior design website built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. The website showcases premium interior design services with a responsive layout, smooth animations, and a clean user experience.

✨ Features

- Luxury and modern landing page
- Responsive design for desktop and mobile
- Elegant hero section
- Interior services showcase
- Project gallery
- Contact / Order form
- Smooth animations and hover effects
- Clean and organized UI

🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript

